[Excess demand congests the system]: "A plausible working hypothesis is that allowing greater demand into the system as a whole than the system is able to service will lead to system congestion" {fidelity: "quotation", pinpoint: "p. 358", note: "Put as a working hypothesis, so hedged.", causes: {from: gap, to: congestion, sign: "+", basis: asserted, hedged: true, chain: congestion}}

